# Third-party notices - Heart of Magic Librarian @PROJECT_VERSION@

## Licenses

- **The plugin DLLs are a GPL-3.0-or-later combined work.** `SKSE/Plugins/SpellLearning.dll`,
  `SKSE/Plugins/SL_BookXP.dll` and `optional/ISLPatch/SKSE/Plugins/DontEatSpellTomes.dll` statically link
  **CommonLibSSE-NG 10.0.0**, which is licensed GPL-3.0-or-later with the **Modding Exception** and the
  **GPL-3.0 Linking Exception**. The DLLs are distributed under those terms:
  `licenses/CommonLibSSE-NG/COPYING.txt` (GNU GPL version 3) and `licenses/CommonLibSSE-NG/EXCEPTIONS.md`
  (the two exceptions).
- **Heart of Magic Librarian's own source files are MIT** (`LICENSE` next to this file): the C++ in the
  repository's `plugins/` (except the `external/` submodule), the Papyrus scripts, the PrismaUI panel and
  the runtime data - apart from the third-party parts listed under "Third-party code and files in this
  project" below, which keep their own licenses. MIT is compatible with the GPL; files you take from this
  project on their own stay MIT.

## Third-party code and files in this project

### Don't Eat Spell Tomes (DEST) by Exit-9B - MIT

The spell tome hook (`plugins/spelllearning/include/SpellTomeHook.h`, `plugins/spelllearning/src/SpellTomeHook.cpp`,
compiled into `SpellLearning.dll`) is based on Don't Eat Spell Tomes by Exit-9B
(<https://github.com/Exit-9B/Dont-Eat-Spell-Tomes>). `optional/ISLPatch/Scripts/Source/DEST_AliasExt.psc` and
`DEST_UIExt.psc` declare DEST's Papyrus functions so the ISL patch script compiles against them. DEST's license:

